      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F662F9A5A4EBA76845E738861611FFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那裡是個難關！\n鼓起勇氣跳過去吧。",
