      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55825582FF0C000A52255927610F556630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "唉呀，很遺憾！\n那裡是死路！",
